+ * -- BMQ --
+ * NORMAL: (lower boost range 12, NICE_WIDTH 40, higher boost range 12) / 2
+ * -- PDS --
+ * NORMAL: SCHED_EDGE_DELTA + ((NICE_WIDTH 40) / 2)
